OL,3,AHeadmaster detained after BBC
OL,4,Ainvestigation into alleged sexual abuse
OL,5,Aof students
OL,6,
OL,7,FA former headmaster of an Islamic
OL,8,Fboarding school in Indonesia has been
OL,9,Fnamed as a suspect in a sexual abuse
OL,10,Finvestigation and detained by police,
OL,11,Ffollowing a BBC Eye report.
OL,13,FAhmad Imanuddin Sumar, known to
OL,14,Fstudents as Abah, led the Abul Barokat
OL,15,Fboarding school on the island of
OL,16,FLombok.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
