OL,3,AHeadmaster detained after BBC
OL,4,Ainvestigation into alleged sexual abuse
OL,5,Aof students
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice reopened the case after the BBC
OL,8,FWorld Service revealed accusations of
OL,9,Fsexual abuse against him, and
OL,10,Fdocumented how former students had
OL,11,Fgathered evidence in an effort to bring
OL,12,Fthe allegations to the authorities.
OL,14,FThe story sparked public outrage and
OL,15,Fled to 12 more former students giving
OL,16,Ftestimony to police.
